OL,3,GNEWSAFirst patients arrive at delayed
OL,4,A#105m rehab centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new #105m NHS rehabilitation facility
OL,7,Fwhich was due to open last year has
OL,8,Fwelcomed its first patients.
OL,10,FThe National Rehabilitation Centre
OL,11,F(NRC) at Stanford Hall,
OL,12,FNottinghamshire, was created to help
OL,13,Fpeople with life-changing illnesses or
OL,14,Finjuries achieve the best recovery
OL,15,Fpossible, and has been 15 years in the
OL,16,Fmaking.
OL,18,FThe state-of-the-art 70-bed facility,
OL,19,Fwhich opened on Wednesday, had been due
OL,20,Fto open on 11 November, but a failed
OL,21,Fwater quality check meant the opening
OL,22,Fwas delayed.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
