OL,3,GNEWSAFirst patients arrive at delayed
OL,4,A#105m rehab centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnthony May, chief executive of
OL,7,FNottingham University Hospitals NHS
OL,8,FTrust (NUH), which runs the site, said
OL,9,Fthe opening was a "significant moment"
OL,10,Ffor rehabilitation medicine in England.
